&lt;li&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; Container Security: Strong hands-on cloud security experience in AWS (with working knowledge of Azure or GCP), along with deep knowledge of Kubernetes (EKS/GKE/AKS) and container security principles.&lt;/li&gt;
